# Only what sandbox-image/Dockerfile copies is sent to the Docker daemon,
# so unrelated changes never invalidate the image's cached layers.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!packages/protocol
!apps/sandbox-supervisor
!sandbox-image
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
